        <head>ΓΑΛΑΤΑΙ</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="unnumbered" ana="#compiled-unnumbered-fragment" xml:id="meineke-0412-galatai-unnumbered">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0412-galatai-unnumbered-l1">Τοῖς γὰρ μεριμνῶσίν τε καὶ λυπουμένοις</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0412-galatai-unnumbered-l2">ἅπασα νὺξ ἔοικε φαίνεσθαι μακρά.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Flor. XCIX 26 cum lemmate Ἀπολλοδώρου Γάλακτος.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">V. Hist. crit. p. 467. Primo versu ante Grotium legebatur τοῖς γὰρ λυπουμένοις τε καὶ μεριμνῶσιν. Correctum ex cod. A. Vide Schaeferi Ind. ad Porsoni Eurip. Hecub. p. 130.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="unnumbered_2" ana="#compiled-unnumbered-fragment #compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0412-galatai-unnumbered_2">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0412-galatai-unnumbered_2-l1">Quoscunque moeror aut cura habet exercitos,</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0412-galatai-unnumbered_2-l2">eis videri longa nox quaevis solet.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
      </div>
